@title 3D view: Move is off by default, so a plain drag cannot move a duct through the wall
@area 3D
# Hardware test KC-15: the 3D toolbar opened with Move on and a drag meant to look around moved parts.
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text open emc example
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
shot move-off
expect_not "✔ Move"
click_text Move #1
wait 10
shot move-on
expect "✔ Move"
